# Cloudflare Pages 响应头：数据 JSON 缓存 15 分钟，带 hash 的静态资源长期缓存
/api/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=900
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
/api/boundaries.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/api/landcover.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
